{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">高盛：奥林巴斯北美内镜业务与近期数据观察</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">8月7日东京时间下午3点30分，奥林巴斯发布<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>财年第<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>财报。当季调整后营业利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">307亿</span>日元，高于GS此前预期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">248亿</span>日元。收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2404亿</span>日元，与预期基本持平。利润<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>的主要来源不是整体销售<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>，而是北美消化内镜业务的高毛利产品组合，以及研发费用低于预期的支出节奏。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份财报值得关注的判断是：奥林巴斯的核心业务增长动力仍然集中在北美消化道内镜市场，EVIS X1和EDOF内镜的采用进展是管理层明确指出的驱动因素。而公司维持全年指引不变，并称首季的强劲开局增强了完成全年目标的信心。GS在财报后将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2031</span>财年的营业利润预测上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVzI5R12bPkiauaKXIZHwkxjibv8sewEOgichY02dv50qttqQ4lg3MfNjib3toTAgZObQohNQzasTrElmwVIdj8XDiazFicK72dU6Rmk/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1.北美消化内镜业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">从分部数据看，消化内镜解决方案部门（GIS）首季销售<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1684亿</span>日元，略高于GS预期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1666亿</span>日元；该部门营业利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">386亿</span>日元，比预期高出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">23%</span>。相比之下，外科及介入解决方案部门（SIS）销售<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">719亿</span>日元，<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">低于预期</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">738亿</span>日元，营业利润为负24亿日元。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">利润<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>的结构值得拆开看。销售端与预期持平，但毛利率明显好于模型假设——毛利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1568亿</span>日元，比预期高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>。GS认为，这主要来自北美GIS业务中EVIS X1和EDOF内镜的采用进展。这两款产品属于高单价、高毛利的内镜系统，其销售占比提升直接<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>了产品组合。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">编辑评论</span>：</strong> 首季利润<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>不是\"卖得更多\"，而是\"卖得更贵\"。北美市场对新一代内镜系统的接受度，是判断后续季度GIS业务利润率能否维持的关键观察点。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWlrty7N44diasRDF64lVtpOAkPkjJPVAjlmgfRI7Yq77PiaGrjj9vr4K6ea1qnQN7gmN7A89lWibpV9mm3Pibda3ylz75JlYrWsWk/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2.业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">首季研发费用<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">209亿</span>日元，比GS预期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">232亿</span>日元低<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10%</span>。GS在更新后的模型中下调了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2031</span>财年的研发费用假设，这是利润预测上调的另一个来源。公司层面维持全年指引不变，管理层在说明会上表示首季是强劲开局。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这里需要区分两个概念：研发费用<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">低于预期</span>是\"节奏问题\"还是\"总量问题\"。首季进度只占全年预期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">22%</span>，如果后续季度研发投入加快，全年研发费用仍可能回到原定区间。GS将全年研发费用预测从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">965亿</span>日元下调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">947亿</span>日元，幅度并不大，说明其判断更接近节奏调整而非项目削减。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXumRTa0fMb2urK27hSJQltQClwibQhO8T5JvtReLDf7PS7GiaBLAPS4ZFzUbVLZsPPvKknUh7icMxhZhI6Wc2nmib8qRuoFv9zTJo/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">研究主题与行业变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">GS将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>财年营业利润预测从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1492亿</span>日元上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1554亿</span>日元，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028</span>财年从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1654亿</span>日元上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1703亿</span>日元，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2029</span>财年从1808亿日元上调至1852亿日元。估值方法采用2028财年预期EV/EBITDA倍数，全球医疗科技板块平均倍数从11.0倍上调至12.0倍，奥林巴斯仍维持10%的折价。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告同时列出了需要持续跟踪的三个事项：核心GIS业务的销售趋势、盈利<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>措施和业务组合优化的进展、以及FDA警告信和进口禁令解除的进度。最后一项对奥林巴斯的美国业务有直接影响，但报告没有给出时间表。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">编辑评论</span>： GS更新公司观点，估值折价处于五年历史平均水平附近。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXTJiaoLJQtY0g41q6aRNFUogWWS9xuSDSqa2fNywJmBfMNLfLZPcmHevhzV6ibmfSGpFc4zvYSoEb08oHI7EJejsjTIKMFuxdPQ/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 09-GS-Olympus -7733.T- 1Q earnings- Profit beat driven mainly by strong North America Endoscope business- 报告观点-260808</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
